# Production Omni service URLs, baked into every production build (`vite build`).
#
# The web deployment also receives these as infra build args, which take
# precedence, so this file is what configures the DESKTOP (Tauri) build, which
# gets no infra env. Without it a desktop build leaves these unset and Better
# Auth falls back to the page origin, which under Tauri is `tauri://localhost`,
# an invalid base URL that Better Auth rejects by throwing at import, blanking
# the whole app. These are public URLs, no secrets. Dev builds (mode development)
# do not load this file, so local modeling stays anonymous and offline.
VITE_FACET_API_URL=https://api.facet.omni.dev
VITE_AUTH_BASE_URL=https://identity.omni.dev
VITE_ACCOUNT_URL=https://account.omni.dev
